# 二进制文件：不做行尾转换，也不尝试文本 diff
*.hex   binary
*.bin   binary
*.apk   binary
*.lib   binary
*.a     binary
*.o     binary
*.axf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary

# Windows 批处理：保持原样，别让 git 改写行尾
# （cmd.exe 对 LF 的标签跳转处理有坑）
*.bat   -text
*.cmd   -text

# vendor 代码不计入 GitHub 语言统计，
# 否则首页会显示「99.6% C」，自己写的 Core/ 被淹掉
Drivers/STM32F1xx_HAL_Driver/**  linguist-vendored
Drivers/CMSIS/**                 linguist-vendored
Middlewares/Third_Party/**       linguist-vendored
MDK-ARM/startup_stm32f103xb.s    linguist-vendored
